[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0010","text":"……嗯，完成了♪"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0020","text":"嗯，千雪小姐\n做得相当不错呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0030","text":"（心里想说的话）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0040","text":"（要好好传达出去）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0050","text":"……和这个发饰一起"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0060","text":"……心意……\n装得满满的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0070","text":"嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0080","text":"（呵呵……一定很合适吧\n　穿上浴衣的甘奈酱和甜花酱）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0090","text":"（好想快点去庙会啊）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0100","text":"啊，对了\n也得跟Producer先生说一声才行"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0110","text":"因为他给了我勇气"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0120","text":"（嘿……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0130","text":"？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0140","text":"……是吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01160000_03_0150","text":"嗯……\n路上小心，千雪"}]
